🤖 Agent Studio

Agent Studio is a visual workspace in Google Cloud for designing, building, testing, and managing AI agents and AI applications. 
It allows you to configure agents, connect models and tools, and experiment with agent workflows with less manual coding.

========

Agent Studio
------------

Agent Studio is more focused on building and experimenting with AI agents and applications through a visual interface.

Instead of writing everything from scratch in Python, you can use the Google Cloud interface to design/test an agent.

Conceptually:

                 Agent Studio
                      ↓
             ┌─────────────────┐
             │      Agent      │
             └────────┬────────┘
                      ↓
                 Gemini/LLM
                      ↓
             ┌────────┼────────┐
             ↓        ↓        ↓
           Tools     Data     Actions

Google describes Agent Studio as a visual environment for designing and building agents.


